# Assets

Static assets: images, fonts, icons, and vendored third-party libraries.

Subfolders will be added in Phase 1+:

- `fonts/` — self-hosted web fonts
- `icons/` — favicon and PWA icons
- `images/` — logos and illustrations
- `vendor/` — Chart.js, Grid.js, SheetJS, Lucide, html2canvas, jsPDF
